stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested: Deploy request received

    Requested --> Pulling: Image not cached
    Requested --> Creating: Image cached

    Pulling --> Creating: Pull complete
    Pulling --> Failed: Pull error

    Creating --> Starting: Container created
    Creating --> Failed: Create error

    Starting --> HealthCheck: Container started
    Starting --> Failed: Start error

    HealthCheck --> Running: Health check passed
    HealthCheck --> Failed: Health check failed (retries exhausted)

    Running --> Monitoring: Enter monitoring loop

    state Monitoring {
        [*] --> CheckHealth
        CheckHealth --> Healthy: Status OK
        CheckHealth --> Unhealthy: Status degraded
        Healthy --> CheckHealth: Poll interval
        Unhealthy --> Recovering: Attempt recovery
        Recovering --> CheckHealth: Recovery succeeded
        Recovering --> FailedInner: Recovery failed
    }

    Monitoring --> IdleDetected: No requests for IDLE_SHUTDOWN_MINUTES
    Monitoring --> Failed: Unrecoverable error

    IdleDetected --> ShuttingDown: Graceful stop
    ShuttingDown --> Stopped: Container removed

    Stopped --> LazyRestart: New request arrives (HELIX_LAZY_INFRA=true)
    LazyRestart --> Creating: Re-create container

    Failed --> Stopped: Cleanup
    Stopped --> [*]
